# Factory keeps its files here. The definitions under .factory/ (config,
# workflows, phases, agents, profiles) are versioned: they are one pipeline that
# runs this sample, for anyone who clones it to use, change or replace.
#
# What a run produces is not versioned: a task's artifacts, Factory's database
# if it lives in this repository, and the backups a bundle import takes.
.factory/tasks/
.factory/state/
.factory/.trash/
